            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-41989",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Libgcrypt: Libgcrypt: Denial of Service and buffer overflow via crafted ECDH ciphertext"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Libgcrypt before 1.12.2 sometimes allows a heap-based buffer overflow and denial of service via crafted ECDH ciphertext to gcry_pk_decrypt."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-41989",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-41989\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: libgcrypt20\nFixed Version: 1.10.1-3+deb12u1\nLink: [CVE-2026-41989](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-41989)\nLibgcrypt before 1.12.2 sometimes allows a heap-based buffer overflow and denial of service via crafted ECDH ciphertext to gcry_pk_decrypt.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-41989**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|libgcrypt20|1.10.1-3+deb12u1|[CVE-2026-41989](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-41989)|\n\nLibgcrypt before 1.12.2 sometimes allows a heap-based buffer overflow and denial of service via crafted ECDH ciphertext to gcry_pk_decrypt."
              },
